sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Operator
    participant CLI as rhai-cli<br/>(kubectl-odh)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GitHub as raw.githubusercontent.com<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(MCP Client)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Lint / Upgrade Readiness Assessment
        User->>CLI: kubectl odh lint --target-version 3.x
        CLI->>K8sAPI: GET DSC, DSCI, CSVs<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (kubeconfig)
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Platform state
        CLI->>K8sAPI: LIST CRDs, Subscriptions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Dependency state
        CLI->>K8sAPI: LIST Notebooks, DSPA,<br/>InferenceService, RayCluster (cluster-wide)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Workload CRs
        Note over CLI: Execute 40+ registered checks<br/>(sequential, deterministic order)
        CLI-->>User: Table/JSON/YAML report to stdout
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over User,TrustyAI: Flow 2: Migration Execution
        User->>CLI: kubectl odh migrate run --target 3.x
        CLI->>K8sAPI: GET DSC (detect current version)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Current version → phase detection
        Note over CLI: DetectPhase(): pre-upgrade /<br/>post-upgrade / pre-enablement

        CLI->>K8sAPI: PATCH DSPA CRD<br/>(v1alpha1 → v1 stored version)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: CRD updated

        CLI->>K8sAPI: GET TrustyAI Routes<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Route endpoints
        CLI->>TrustyAI: GET /metrics (backup)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS 1.2 (InsecureSkipVerify)
        TrustyAI-->>CLI: Metrics data

        CLI->>K8sAPI: PATCH Notebook CRs<br/>(auth model, container names)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Notebooks updated

        Note over CLI: StepRecorder: hierarchical<br/>result tree with status
        CLI-->>User: Structured migration report (JSON/YAML)
    end

    rect rgb(240, 230, 255)
        Note over Agent,K8sAPI: Flow 3: MCP Server (AI Agent Integration)
        Agent->>CLI: MCP tool call (stdio or SSE/8080)<br/>e.g., lint, status, get
        Note over CLI: ToolAdapter: clone ConfigFlags,<br/>map args → Command
        CLI->>K8sAPI: Execute command operations<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (inherited kubeconfig)
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Results
        CLI-->>Agent: MCP CallToolResult<br/>(structured output)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over CLI,GitHub: Flow 4: Dependency Refresh
        User->>CLI: kubectl odh deps --refresh
        CLI->>GitHub: GET odh-gitops manifest<br/>(pinned commit 1a55af0)<br/>No Auth
        GitHub-->>CLI: Dependency manifest YAML
        CLI->>K8sAPI: LIST Subscriptions, CSVs,<br/>PackageManifests<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Installed operator state
        CLI-->>User: Dependency status report
    end
